DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45076::$$$message_0404_0000_0000$$$::"My castle! The workshop of Kayneth El-Melloi Archibald, ahhhhhh!"::
45077::$$$message_0404_0000_0001$$$::"I feel your shame, my lord. The disgrace of being robbed of an honorable duel pains me just as well."::
45078::$$$message_0404_0000_0002$$$::"That's not the same! How did you fail to catch the rats playing their dirty tricks in our house!? You're even more useless than a pet cat!"::
45079::$$$message_0404_0000_0003$$$::"...It is as you say, my lord."::
45080::$$$message_0404_0000_0004$$$::"Whoever they are, they are an affront to magery. I will give them what they deserve for laying waste to a workshop that I personally crafted..."::
45081::$$$message_0404_0000_0005$$$::"How long are you going to keep dwelling on your failures, Kayneth? We can't help it if a terrorist bombing was the finale. [wvl canskip=false time=150]A terrorist finale."::
45082::$$$message_0404_0000_0006$$$::"Why'd you say that twice?"::
45083::$$$message_0404_0000_0007$$$::"Sola-Ui...but..."::
45084::$$$message_0404_0000_0008$$$::"Forgive the interruption, my lord, Lady Sola-Ui. This letter just arrived. It appears to be an invitation."::
45085::$$$message_0404_0000_0009$$$::"A little late for an apology from the hotel. Wait...I sense power from it. It's dangerous, Kayneth."::
45086::$$$message_0404_0000_0010$$$::"No, this is... Oh? Splendid. Look, Sola-Ui."::
45087::$$$message_0404_0000_0011$$$::"'An all-powerful onsen that grants any wish'? That sounds just like the Holy Grail... Wait, it also says 'first come, first served.'"::
45088::$$$message_0404_0000_0012$$$::"...Then we go to war. By the way, Lancer. Do you know how to play cards?"::
45089::$$$message_0404_0000_0013$$$::"Why do you ask?"::
45090::$$$message_0404_0000_0014$$$::"It says here that we must play an Oriental card-matching game called 'hanafuda' to reach the Holy Grail Onsen."::
45091::$$$message_0404_0000_0015$$$::"I'm sorry to say that I have terrible luck at games of chance...[wvl canskip=false time=150][hffgchg2 chara=ランサー4th face=不安 pos=left time=400 twno=1] In fact, I've been called the greatest sucker of the Knights of Fianna."::
45092::$$$message_0404_0000_0016$$$::"Lancer..."::
45093::$$$message_0404_0000_0017$$$::"However! I swear upon my honor that I will bring you victory, my lord[line len=2]"::
45094::$$$message_0404_0000_0018$$$::"Silence, Lancer. I expect nothing from you. Cards are gentlemen's games. You simply need to follow my orders."::
45095::$$$message_0404_0000_0019$$$::"...As you say, lord. Diarmuid Ua Duibhne is ever your loyal servant."::
45096::$$$message_0404_0000_0020$$$::"I will wish for the greatest magical workshop! An unassailable fortress of magecraft, impervious to petty bombs and bunker busters!"::
45097::$$$message_0404_0000_0021$$$::"And we'll stop at nothing to... Well, whatever."::
45098::$$$message_0404_0000_0022$$$::"Hey, Kayneth? Does that onsen have...mixed baths?"::
45099::$$$message_0404_0000_0023$$$::"Huh?[wvl canskip=false time=200] Mixed baths?[wvl canskip=false time=100] U-[wvl canskip=false time=100]um, I don't know."::
45100::$$$message_0404_0000_0024$$$::"I'm sure it does! You'd prefer that, wouldn't you? Then let's get going! Okay?[wvl canskip=false time=100][hffgchg2 chara=ソラウ face=照れ pos=left time=300 twno=1] (glance)"::
45101::$$$message_0404_0000_0025$$$::"Urgh!"::
45102::$$$message_0404_0000_0026$$$::"Y-yes, of course, Sola-Ui! I will use this victory to let you spread your wings!"::
45103::$$$message_0404_0000_0027$$$::"..."::
45104::$$$message_0404_0000_0028$$$::(Why doesn't my lord notice my loyalty!?)::

